# Keep build contexts lean and deterministic
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.git
**/*.md
**/.env*
!**/.env.sample
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
# Fetched basemap assets (satellite/terrain/night JPGs + geojson). NOT baked
# into any image — provided at runtime via the shared ./data bind-mount in
# docker-compose. Run ./fetch-assets.sh to populate locally.
public/public/data
